5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"To avoid repeating past failures, I will examine the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the data agreements with outside surgeries.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I need to know if we have the physical capacity. I'll look into rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and what the booking system records.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect the cracks appear in the partnerships. I shall review the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm worried about the people doing the work! I'll check the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, and the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,A wise start. I shall look into this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location to see what is sustainable.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
